<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>As used in this article, the following terms have the following meanings:</p><p>(a)<span class="EnSpace"/>“Director” means the Director of the Office of Privacy Protection.</p><p>(b)<span class="EnSpace"/>“Office” means the Office of Privacy Protection.</p></caml:Content>